{
  "_comment": "Reference engines for head-to-head runs. 'pin' is the commit the published 2026-10-29 sweep used (benchmark_results/sweep_h2h_2026-10-29/system_info.txt); setup_engines.py --ref latest|<sha> overrides it. 'runner' tells h2h_bench.py how to call the binary: ref = llama-completion style (-no-cnv), cli = llama-cli style (no -no-cnv flag).",
